          "Prompt:\nEvaluate this summary against the original document using this rubric:\n\nSummary: [summary to evaluate]\nDocument: [original document]\n\nRubric:\n1. Factuality (1-5): Is every claim supported by the document?\n2. Completeness (1-5): Does it cover all major points?\n3. Clarity (1-5): Would a typical reader understand it?\n\n---\n\nResponse:\n1. Factuality: 4/5 - All major points accurate; one statistic rounded differently than source\n2. Completeness: 5/5 - All key points covered\n3. Clarity: 5/5 - Clear structure and language"
        ]
      ]
